`Generate a weekly development summary for the repo: {{ $json.repo }} (week: {{ $json.weekStart }} to {{ $json.weekEnd }}).

Language: {{ $json.lang }} (EN or FR)

Stats:
- Commits this week: {{ $json.commitCount }}
- Closed issues: {{ $json.issueCount }}
- Merged PRs: {{ $json.prCount }}

Recent commits:
{{ $json.commits.join('\n') }}

Closed issues:
{{ $json.issues.join('\n') }}

Merged PRs:
{{ $json.prs.join('\n') }}

Write a professional, engaging narrative summary in the requested language. Include highlights, trends, and key achievements. Keep it concise but informative. Output ONLY the summary text, no headings.`
